0..40 Comment "// This source encodes strings as UTF-8."
41..43 Comment "//"
44..120 Comment "// UTF-8 uses one to four bytes for each code point. The leading byte states"
121..192 Comment "// how many bytes follow. Each following byte carries six bits. Unicode"
193..241 Comment "// Standard 15.0 specifies these byte sequences."
242..244 Comment "//"
245..317 Comment "// `encode` selects bytes by range. `encodeAll` encodes each code point."
